\n<br>Conductance (NaCl) &gt; Conductance (BaSO<sub>4</sub>)"},"hi":{"content":"चलिए C<sub>NaCl</sub> \nऔर C<sub>BaSO<sub>4</sub></sub> को ऊष्मीय तापक्रम T पर NaCl\nऔर BaSO<sub>4</sub> के संतृप्त जलीय विलयनों के मापा गया चालकता (S में) कहते हैं।\nनिम्नलिखित में से कौन सा गलत है?\n","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"दोनों लवणों से आयनों की आयोनिक गतिशीलता तापमान T के साथ बढ़ती है।"},{"identifier":"B","content":"C<sub>NaCl</sub>(T<sub>2</sub>) &gt;  C<sub>NaCl</sub>(T<sub>1</sub>) जब T<sub>2</sub> &gt; T<sub>1</sub>"},{"identifier":"C","content":"C<sub>BaSO<sub>4</sub></sub>(T<sub>2</sub>) &gt;  C<sub>BaSO<sub>4</sub></sub>(T<sub>1</sub>) जब T<sub>2</sub> &gt; T<sub>1</sub>"},{"identifier":"D","content":"किसी दिए गए T पर C<sub>NaCl</sub> &gt;&gt; C<sub>BaSO<sub>4</sub></sub>"}],"correct_options":["D"],"answer":null,"explanation":null,"comprehension":null,"direction":null}},"question_id":"HjakCQRwzFuKTw4SW3jgy2xukf2clg52","updated_time":null,"permalink":"let-csubnaclsub-and-csubbasosub4subsub-be-th-jee-main-chemistry-solutions-xnkw7tfeo5ob6bec","topic":"conductance-and-electrolysis","paperId":"jee-main-2020-online-3rd-september-morning-slot","isOutOfSyllabus":false,"isBonus":false,"tags":["multi_statements"],"yearKey":"jee-main-2020-online-3rd-september-morning-slot","active":true},{"country":"in","examGroup":"jee","exam":"jee-main","subjectGroup":null,"subject":"chemistry","chapterGroup":"organic-chemistry","chapter":"basics-of-organic-chemistry","year":2020,"paperTitle":"JEE Main 2020 (Online) 3rd September Morning Slot","timeAllotted":144000,"marks":4,"negMarks":1,"languages":["en"],"difficulty":"medium","topicName":null,"type":"mcq","examDate":"2020-09-03 09:00","question":{"en":{"content":"Which one of the following compounds possesses the most acidic hydrogen?","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"H<sub>3</sub>C - C <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.081ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/sv